+# Expose the authenticated identity to templates as the `user` global:
+# user = { id, username, role } with a valid Authorization: Bearer token
+# (verified: signature, expiry, issuer), user = null for anonymous
+# visitors, disabled [auth], or tokens that fail verification. Templates
